  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Issue 465: Primordial Salvos adds a same-school salvo to every unleashed Glyph",
  "contract": [
    "Primordial Salvos 800752 (passive, one dummy aura) reads 'Unleashing a Glyph now deals an additional",
    "${$800730m1+$SP*0.06} damage of the same magic school to all enemies within $800730a1 yds of the target.'",
    "The salvos are Frost Salvo 800730 (Frost), Flame Salvo 800729 (Fire) and Arcane Salvo 800731 (Arcane): each",
    "SCHOOL_DAMAGE BasePoints 114 at TARGET_DEST_TARGET_ENEMY with TARGET_UNIT_DEST_AREA_ENEMY, radius index 14",
    "(8 yd). Nothing cast them on main, and their stock EffectBonusMultiplier (0 after the stock-coefficient",
    "clearing for 800730, 0.8 for the other two) is not the tooltip's 6%. Expected: a Glyph released by",
    "Thaumaturgy 804550 without the talent launches no salvo; with it, the Frost Glyph 520090 launches one Frost",
    "Salvo that hits the target and an enemy 4 yd from it but not one 17 yd away, the Flame Glyph 520091 launches a",
    "Flame Salvo and no Frost Salvo, and every salvo carries 6% of spell power (Drink Fel Infusion 44505 supplies",
    "+2000). The 'all enemies' wording against the salvos' MaxAffectedTargets 4 is not covered. The gain per",
    "point of spell power is 0.06 times the caster's own percentage damage-done multipliers (1.11 for this fixture:",
    "the unmodified salvo reads 1110 of 1000), hence windows of 0.059-0.07; before the fix it read 0 and 0.8."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
